@startuml WF-02_Guest_Information_Recommendation
title WF-02: Guest Information & Recommendation (Feature F-02 | Scenarios DS-03, DS-04)\nProject: Intelligent Hotel Concierge Robot (HC-Robot) - FA26SE905 | Baseline: review-2

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #334155
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #D97706
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 13
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #64748B

|Concierge Robot|
start
:Monitor lobby in standby screensaver mode;
note right
  **Initial Entity State**
  Robot.status = **IDLE**
end note

|Hotel Guest|
:Approach robot detection zone or tap touchscreen;

|Concierge Robot|
:Detect guest presence and initialize interaction session;
note right
  **Entity State Transition**
  Robot.status: **IDLE -> INTERACTING**
  ChatSession.is_active = **True**
end note
:Play welcome greeting and display language selection\n(Vietnamese / English);

|Hotel Guest|
if (Guest selects language within 15s inactivity window?) then (Yes - Language selected)
  :Select preferred language (VI or EN);

  |Concierge Robot|
  :Configure active session language and start listening;

  repeat
    |Hotel Guest|
    if (Guest provides voice or touch query within 15s?) then (Yes - DS-03: Query submitted)
      :Ask question about hotel facilities, services,\npromotions, or indoor directions;

      |Concierge Robot|
      :Transcribe input and process query via Hybrid AI\nand RAG Knowledge Base;
      :Speak response and display hotel information,\nrecommendations, or interactive wayfinding map/QR;

      |Hotel Guest|
    else (No - DS-04: Inactivity >= 15s during conversation)
      |Concierge Robot|
      :Detect 15-second conversation inactivity timeout;
      note right
        **Exception Scenario DS-04**
        Guest abandoned conversation mid-session.
        No feedback rating is forced or recorded.
      end note
      :Cancel active listening, flush conversation context,\nand close session without recording feedback;
      :Return to lobby screensaver mode;
      note right
        **Entity State Transition**
        Robot.status: **INTERACTING -> IDLE**
      end note
      stop
    endif
  repeat while (Guest continues asking another question?) is (Yes - Continue interaction) not (No - End of questions)

  |Concierge Robot|
  :Display feedback prompt (1 to 5 stars);

  |Hotel Guest|
  if (Guest submits rating before 15s timeout?) then (Yes - DS-03: Rating submitted)
    :Select star rating and submit feedback;

    |Concierge Robot|
    :Persist guest rating and display thank-you message;
    note right
      **Entity State Transition**
      Feedback.rating = **RECORDED (1..5)**
      (Linked to session_id in feedbacks table)
    end note
  else (No - DS-04: Guest leaves or dismisses without rating)
    |Concierge Robot|
    :Detect feedback timeout / dismissal and skip rating creation;
    note right
      **Exception Scenario DS-04**
      Feedback.rating is **NOT created**
      when guest leaves without submitting.
    end note
  endif

else (No - DS-04: Guest walks away before selecting language [>= 15s])
  |Concierge Robot|
  :Detect 15-second inactivity timeout before interaction starts;
endif

|Concierge Robot|
:Flush conversation session memory and reset kiosk UI;
:Transition back to standby mode;
note right
  **Entity State Transition**
  Robot.status: **INTERACTING -> IDLE**
end note
stop

@enduml

